 [[knives|knife]], [[forks|fork]] [[and]] [[spoons|spoon]] [[for]] [[twelve]] [[people]]. \`[[Who]] [[had|have]] [[twelve]] [[people]] [[for]] [[dinner]]?\` Quang [[asks|ask]]. \`[[Maybe]] [[the]] [[old]] [[woman]] [[in]] [[the]] [[photo]],\` [[says|say]] [[Mum]].`,`vn`:`Trong t\u1ee7 b\u1ebfp, m\u1eb9 t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u0129a v\u00e0 b\u00e1t c\u0169 v\u1ebd hoa xanh. C\u00f3 dao, d\u0129a v\u00e0 th\u00eca cho m\u01b0\u1eddi hai ng\u01b0\u1eddi. \`Ai m\u00e0 m\u1eddi t\u1edbi m\u01b0\u1eddi hai ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0103n t\u1ed1i nh\u1ec9?\` Quang h\u1ecfi. \`C\u00f3 l\u1ebd l\u00e0 b\u00e0 c\u1ee5 trong \u1ea3nh,\` m\u1eb9 n\u00f3i.`},{`en`:`[[That]] [[evening]], Uyen [[helps|help]] [[with]] [[the]] [[washing]] [[of]] [[the]] [[dishes|dish]]. [[She]] [[washes|wash]] [[the]] [[old]] [[plates|plate]] [[with]] [[lots|lot]] [[of]] [[soap]]. [[Soon]] [[there]] [[is|be]] [[soap]] [[on]] [[the]] [[floor]], [[soap]] [[on]] Miu [[and]] [[soap]] [[in]] [[her]] [[hair]]. [[Mum]] [[gives|give]] [[her]] [[a]] [[towel]] [[and]] [[a]] [[brush]]. \`[[Now]] [[tidy]] [[the]] [[kitchen]], [[please]],\` [[she]] [[says|say]]. Uyen [[tidies|tidy]] [[it]] [[very]] [[slowly]].`,`vn`:`T\u1ed1i \u0111\u00f3, Uy\u00ean gi\u00fap m\u1eb9 r\u1eeda b\u00e1t. B\u00e9 r\u1eeda \u0111\u1ed1ng \u0111\u0129a c\u0169 v\u1edbi th\u1eadt nhi\u1ec1u x\u00e0 ph\u00f2ng. Ch\u1eb3ng m\u1ea5y ch\u1ed1c, x\u00e0 ph\u00f2ng d\u00ednh \u0111\u1ea7y s\u00e0n, d\u00ednh l\u00ean c\u1ea3 Miu v\u00e0 c\u1ea3 t\u00f3c b\u00e9. M\u1eb9 \u0111\u01b0a cho b\u00e9 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i b\u00e0n ch\u1ea3i. \`Gi\u1edd th\u00ec d\u1ecdn b\u1ebfp cho g\u1ecdn nh\u00e9,\` m\u1eb9 n\u00f3i. Uy\u00ean d\u1ecdn th\u1eadt ch\u1eadm, th\u1eadt ch\u1eadm.`},{`en`:`[[At]] [[midnight]], Quang [[wakes|wake]] [[up]]. [[He]] [[can]] [[hear]] [[music]]. [[Someone]] [[is|be]] [[playing|play]] [[the]] [[piano]]. [[The]] [[music]] [[is|be]] [[soft]] [[and]] [[beautiful]]. [[He]] [[gets|get]] [[out]] [[of]] [[bed]]. [[It]] [[is|be]] [[coming|come]] [[from]] [[the]] [[little]] [[room]] [[in]] [[the]] [[corner]].`,`vn`:`N\u1eeda \u0111\u00eam, Quang t\u1ec9nh gi\u1ea5c. C\u1eadu nghe th\u1ea5y ti\u1ebfng nh\u1ea1c. C\u00f3 ai \u0111\u00f3 \u0111ang ch\u01a1i piano. Ti\u1ebfng \u0111\u00e0n khe kh\u1ebd v\u00e0 r\u1ea5t hay. C\u1eadu ra kh\u1ecfi gi\u01b0\u1eddng. Ti\u1ebfng nh\u1ea1c ph\u00e1t ra t\u1eeb c\u0103n ph\u00f2ng nh\u1ecf trong g\u00f3c.`},{`en`:`Quang [[walks|walk]] [[to]] [[the]] [[door]]. [[He]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[little]] [[afraid]]. [[He]] [[puts|put]] [[his]] [[hand]] [[on]] [[the]] [[door]], [[and]] [[the]] [[music]] [[stops|stop]].`,`vn`:`Quang b\u01b0\u1edbc t\u1edbi c\u00e1nh c\u1eeda. C\u1eadu h\u01a1i s\u1ee3. C\u1eadu \u0111\u1eb7t tay l\u00ean c\u00e1nh c\u1eeda, v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfng nh\u1ea1c t\u1eaft ng\u1ea5m.`}],`tease`:`Ai \u0111ang ch\u01a1i \u0111\u00e0n trong c\u0103n ph\u00f2ng kh\u00f3a k\u00edn?`}]}